<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Not found - EdgeLinkouts</title>
    <style>
      /* Error pages render without the app stylesheet or layout (render_errors is
         configured with layout: false), so this is a standalone, dark-aware document. */
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        background: #fafafa;
        color: #1a1a2e;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body {
          background: #1e2430;
          color: #f3f4f6;
        }
      }
      main {
        max-width: 30rem;
        padding: 2rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      a {
        color: #6366f1;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Page not found</h1>
      <p>The edge id was not found. It may be a typo, or the edge is not stored here.</p>
      <p><a href="/random">Open a random relationship instead</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
